      "id": "m78",
      "about_topic": true,
      "says": "rule: a driver must reduce speed and proceed with caution when approaching a stopped emergency vehicle with red or red and blue lights flashing or a stopped tow truck with amber lights flashing in the same direction of travel"
    },
    {
      "id": "m79",
      "about_topic": true,
      "says": "rule: if the roadway has two or more lanes in the same direction, a driver must move into a lane away from the stopped emergency vehicle or tow truck if safe, in addition to the m78 duty"
    }
